Response:
{% assign said = SpeechResult | downcase %}
{% assign confidence = Confidence | plus: 0 %}

{% if said == blank %}
  We did not hear anything. Goodbye.



{% elsif said contains "harry" or said contains "marv" or said contains "wet bandit" %}
  The Wet Bandits are not welcome at this residence. The house is protected. Goodbye.



{% elsif confidence > 0 and confidence < 0.5 %}

    Sorry, we did not catch that. Please say your name and the reason for your call.

  We did not hear anything. Goodbye.



{% elsif said contains "kate" or said contains "mom" or said contains "peter" or said contains "dad" or said contains "buzz" or said contains "frank" %}
  Thank you. Connecting you now.

    +18475550100

  If no one picked up, please try again later. Goodbye.


{% elsif said contains "nero" or said contains "pizza" %}
  Little Nero's. Connecting you now. And keep the change, ya filthy animal.

    +18475550100

  If no one picked up, please leave the pizza on the front step. Goodbye.



{% else %}
  Thank you. No one can come to the phone right now. Please leave a message after the tone.

{% endif %}
